      "installationSummary": "Aroma with WiiUPluginLoaderBackend and a trusted local network. The server runs while the plugin is loaded; its configuration menu shows the console IP and port. System-file access is disabled by default. Extract the official ZIP, then copy ftpiiu.wps to sd:/wiiu/environments/aroma/plugins/ftpiiu.wps. The ZIP is flat: copying its contents only to the SD root is insufficient. Reboot Aroma, open its plugin menu with L + D-pad Down + Minus, then connect an FTP client to the displayed address. Keep system-file access disabled unless you specifically need it."
